<title>UK: Advent Intl names Barclay investment director.</title>
<headline>Advent Intl names Barclay investment director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private equity investor Advent International said on Wednesday Bruce Barclay had joined the group as investment director in London from KPMG Corporate Finance.</p>
<p>Barclay was previously UK M&amp;A co-ordinator at KPMG.</p>
<p>Advent, which has some $2.5 billion under management, recently announced the closing of a new fund GPE III, which is expected to raise $900 million.</p>
<p>The fund will target management buy-outs, managment buy-ins and expanding companies in the UK and continental Europe.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 5887</p>
